# SPEC-145 SPEC-144 the conditions are checked again when the row is chosen: with the memory gone by then, nothing is downloaded and the text explains
# parts: download-all
# fakes: fakes/hvsc_archive
# fixture: collections/85/C64Music/DOCUMENTS C64Music/DOCUMENTS
key Tab
key 5
expect rows matches "Download everything"
fake memory.available_mib 100
# The row before the last one, "Rebuild the index".
key End
key Up
key Enter
